# Changelog

## 2.5.1

- Extend manifest permissions with known signing certificates for trusted first-party access
- Split permission namespaces to avoid duplicate-permission conflicts between app variants
- Hide plugin handlers whose permission is not held by the current app build
- Document the signing certificates and the two-alias plugin permission protocol

## Features

- Plugin system for launch and shortcut creation (docs & example on GitHub)
- Launch favorites using Quick Settings tile by @khaled-0
- Favorites and recently used activities
- Sharing of shortcuts via URL
- Translation updates

## Fixes

- Incremental loading should fix crashes due to binder buffer exhaustion

## Other improvements/changes

- Package cache
